        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARPAR, Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe stately ambience of the Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset makes it a great choice for period style homes or anywhere an opulent look is desired. The beading on the rose and the knob gives the Parthenon Knobset a classic feel that keeps its finer details from appearing too ornate. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Parthenon Door Knob will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARPAR Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Projection: 2.15\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARPAR-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262184\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARPAR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset",
                "description": "Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset Grandeur PARPAR - The stately ambience of the Beaded Parthenon Interior Knobset makes it a great choice for period style homes or anywhere an opulent look is desired. The beading on the rose and the knob gives the Parthenon Knobset a classic feel that keeps its finer details from appearing too ornate. This Grandeur made Parthenon Plate With Parthenon Door Knob will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
